# The build context of deploy/Dockerfile (R-21). The image installs its own dependencies with
# npm ci and builds dist itself: copying the developer's copies would overwrite them, and
# node_modules installed on Windows does not run on Linux. Local environment files (Vite keeps
# real values in .env*.local) and private keys stay out too, in any folder (`**/`);
# test/docker/image.sh checks each.
node_modules
dist
.__mf__temp
**/.env*
**/*.local
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
